{"id":"be043eb55dfff728","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer.md","title":"ZFC Cat Coequalizer","display":"df-zfc-cat-coequalizer — ZFC Cat Coequalizer","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer"],"display":"df-zfc-cat-coequalizer — ZFC Cat Coequalizer","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat-coequalizer — ZFC Cat Coequalizer"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a556f16d9432aae2\" href=\"?note=a556f16d9432aae2\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-hom.md\">../batch02/58-df-hom.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,Q,A,B,f,g,\\mathcal C,C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\">\\(q,Q,A,B,f,g,\\mathcal C,C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a556f16d9432aae2\" href=\"?note=a556f16d9432aae2\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-hom.md\">../batch02/58-df-hom.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoequalizer}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoequalizer}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}coequalizer}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoequalizer}_S(q,Q,A,B,f,g,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,Q\\in C_0\\land f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,Q)\\land q\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,X)\\;\\left(h\\circ f=h\\circ g\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\;(u\\circ q=h)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}coequalizer}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoequalizer}_S(q,Q,A,B,f,g,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,Q\\in C_0\\land f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,Q)\\land q\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,X)\\;\\left(h\\circ f=h\\circ g\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\;(u\\circ q=h)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-hom.md","status":"resolved","id":"a556f16d9432aae2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-hom.md","status":"resolved","id":"a556f16d9432aae2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"q,Q,A,B,f,g,\\mathcal C,C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoequalizer}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat\\text{-}coequalizer}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcCatCoequalizer}_S(q,Q,A,B,f,g,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\exists C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathcal C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(\\mathcal C)\\land A,B,Q\\in C_0\\land f,g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(A,B)\\land q\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,Q)\\land q\\circ f=q\\circ g\\land\\forall X\\in C_0\\;\\forall h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(B,X)\\;\\left(h\\circ f=h\\circ g\\to\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(Q,X)\\;(u\\circ q=h)\\right)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1267,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1555","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer.md|58-df-zfc-cat-coequalizer]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c","a556f16d9432aae2"]}